cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The Portable Coach: Which NFL Coaching Effects Transfer Across Rosters, and How Confidently"
authors:
  - family-names: Humphrey
    given-names: Nathan
date-released: 2026-05
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/mrnathanhumphrey-droid/two-locus-nfl-coaching"
abstract: >
  Replication package for the four-layer multi-resolution decomposition
  of NFL coaching effects 2000-2025. Every result reproduces from frozen inputs with
  `bash reproduce.sh`. Tests the same (HC, OC, DC) partition
  at season-aggregate, within-season event-study, within-game schematic,
  and within-game stress-adaptation resolutions under identical SNR
  discipline (B=1000 permutation null, cross-season holdout,
  propensity-matched event design). Includes pre-registered teammate
  composition null, predictive-validation slopes (HC + OC), placebo
  + influence robustness checks, defensive personnel-vs-coaching
  variance decomposition, and coach fingerprint clustering.
license: MIT
keywords:
  - nfl
  - coaching
  - event-study
  - permutation-null
  - propensity-matching
  - sports-analytics
